Care for your jewelry can be cleaned with a delicate hand-[washing detergent] and[ water with a soft cloth,] so as not to scratch any beads,[ crystal], and rhin[estones].
The best way to[ clean] the jewelry is[ to first spot] clean with the soft[ cloth and a bit of the detergent,] and[ then wipe softly with a] slightly damp[ cloth (water).]

